<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Gibson Chemical half yr profit rises.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Gibson Chemical half yr profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to Dec 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit			7.52 vs 7.91</p>
<p>    Net					13.12 vs 4.92</p>
<p>    Abnormal items		  gain 13.58 vs nil</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		     14.0 vs 14.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Gibson Chemical Industries Ltd is a chemical and plastics maker. Abnormal profit was result of partial sale of United States operations.  </p>
<p>    Sales				   84.04 vs 79.09</p>
<p>    Other income			   1.08 vs 1.31</p>
<p>Dividend is fully franked</p>
<p>Pay date May 7</p>
<p>Reg date April 16</p>
<p>    Tax					7.91 vs 2.87</p>
<p>    Interest				 0.82 vs 0.96</p>
<p>    Depreciation			   3.26 vs 2.91</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
